Subject: [PATCH] Diagnose Windows child tokens and remove duplicate launcher
 startup

Diagnostic branch only. The original runtime and host unit targets time out before tests start in native run 38897557084. Keep filtering, deterministic sharding, command-line batching and failure aggregation in one PowerShell process. Add native fixture coverage for preserved behavior and query the actual spawned sandbox child token without changing permissions or assertions. Maintained just fmt-check passes; native behavior validation remains required. Do not merge token tracing or timing markers into production.
